---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const BASE = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Felix Geelhaar"
  description="Field Notes — long-form essays on shipping software with AI agents. Plus the open-source Go libraries and the Atlassian Marketplace app I build at the same time."
  nav="home"
  ogImage="home"
>
  <section class="page-header" style="border-bottom: none;">
    <h1>
      Field notes on how teams ship software &mdash; and the tools that make pairing
      with AI agents feel less like a sword fight.
    </h1>
    <p class="lede">
      Long-form essays on plan-of-record, evidence layers, agent runtimes, and the
      anti-patterns engineering teams ship when a model is in the loop. Plus the
      Go libraries I build alongside them.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="prose">
    <h2>What's here</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><a href={`${BASE}writing`}>Writing</a> &mdash; <strong>Field Notes</strong>, long-form essays on shipping software with AI agents.</li>
      <li><a href={`${BASE}lab`}>Lab</a> &mdash; the open-source Go libraries + AI-agent tooling, plus <a href={`${BASE}armada`}>Armada</a> (paid, Atlassian Marketplace).</li>
      <li><a href={`${BASE}armada`}>Armada</a> &mdash; campaign orchestration for Jira. Marketplace app + canonical site at <a href="https://armada.run">armada.run</a>.</li>
      <li><a href={`${BASE}about`}>About</a> &mdash; the long bio.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Right now</h2>
    <p>
      Building <a href="https://github.com/klarlabs-studio/nomi">nomi</a> (local-first coding agent),
      <a href="https://github.com/felixgeelhaar/roady">roady</a> (plan-of-record),
      <a href="https://github.com/felixgeelhaar/tokenops">tokenops</a> (LLM rate-limit telemetry),
      <a href="https://nox-hq.dev">nox</a> (AI-app security scanner), and the rest of a small Go
      stack for agent infra &mdash; see <a href={`${BASE}lab`}>/lab</a> for the full shelf, <a href={`${BASE}now`}>/now</a> for current focus.
    </p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
